{"v":[[1,"The fool hath said in his heart, There is no God. They are corrupt, they have done abominable works, there is none that doeth good."],[2,"The Lord looked down from heaven upon the children of men, to see if there were any that did understand, and seek God."],[3,"They are all gone aside, they are all together become filthy: there is none that doeth good, no, not one."],[4,"Have all the workers of iniquity no knowledge? who eat up my people as they eat bread, and call not upon the Lord."],[5,"There were they in great fear: for God is in the generation of the righteous."],[6,"Ye have shamed the counsel of the poor, because the Lord is his refuge."],[7,"Oh that the salvation of Israel were come out of Zion! when the Lord bringeth back the captivity of his people, Jacob shall rejoice, and Israel shall be glad."]],"w":{"1":[["'amar","he says","H559"],["naval","a fool","H5036"],["be-lib-o","in heart his","H3820"],["'ein","there not","H369"],["'elohim","[is] a god","H430"],["hishchitu","they act corruptly","H7843"],["hit'ivu","they do abominably","H8581"],["'alilah","deed[s]","H5949"],["'ein","there not","H369"],["'oseh","[is one who] does","H6213"],["tov","<of> good","H2896"]],"2":[["yahweh","Yahweh","H3068"],["mi-shamayim","from heaven","H8064"],["hishkif","he looks down","H8259"],["'al","on","H5921"],["benei","[the] children of","H1121"],["'adam","humankind","H120"],["li-r'ot","to see","H7200"],["ha-yesh","¿ [is] there","H3426"],["maskil","[one who] acts prudently","H7919"],["doresh","[one who] seeks","H1875"],["'et","<obj.>","H853"],["'elohim","God","H430"]],"3":[["ha-kol","<the> everyone","H3605"],["sar","he turns aside","H5493"],["yachdav","all together","H3162"],["ne'elachu","they are corrupt","H444"],["'ein","there not","H369"],["'oseh","[is one who] does","H6213"],["tov","<of> good","H2896"],["'ein","there not","H369"],["gam","also","H1571"],["'echad","[is] one","H259"]],"4":[["ha-lo'","¿ not","H3808"],["yade'u","do they know","H3045"],["kol","all","H3605